  "method": "Fixed V9 models and scores. Integrated policy correction: pulse-level positive retention in first2 candidate feasibility, late2 certification and all4 veto; selectable pending-after-clear finite-confidence release within each original pulse deadline. No forced release after clear, no deadline extension by later pulses, no unknown-after-clear release; unavailable reference cancels pending. All releases are actual alarms.",
