  "calibration": "Unchanged low/high threshold grids, normal exposure and primary event minima. First2 chronological past blocks choose one proposal; last2 certify or return V6 with no alternate search. Four-block original-axis veto remains. Pulse coverage must occur in the same contiguous known-positive segment within120s of the pulse positive intersection; independent rescue cannot hide a missing confirmation response.",
